# Agent-emitted proposal: extend the member role with a grant that is
# NOT in the permission catalog (path($.permissions.billing_refund)). The list spread's
# refer() makes this a located [aontu/refer_unresolved] error -- a
# hallucinated permission cannot land. (The first three elements
# restate the existing grants: lists unify by position, so an
# extension must repeat the prefix.)
@"../roles.aon"
roles: member: grants: [path($.permissions.project_read), path($.permissions.project_write), path($.permissions.member_read), path($.permissions.billing_refund)]
